# Known violations of the CSS architecture contract (web/css/README.md).
#
# Format: <check> <item>   # optional note
#
# This file is the outstanding debt of the CSS restructure. Entries may be
# removed, never added: a new violation is a build failure, and an entry that
# stops matching anything is also a failure, so the file cannot rot.
#
# Audit what is still owed:  node scripts/lint-css-arch --emit-allowlist

# --- token-parity ---------------------------------------------------------
# Two bare var()s that resolve to nothing, so the whole declaration is dropped:
# styles.css:3478 (outline) and prism-theme.css:142 (inside a color-mix, which
# takes the rest of the value with it).
token-parity --accent-color
token-parity --text-muted

# Theme-independent tokens that share the dark theme's :root block only because
# dark was written first. They move to tokens/scale.css.
token-parity --modal-scrim
token-parity --overlay-dark-70
token-parity --overlay-dark-50
token-parity --overlay-dark-25
token-parity --overlay-dark-15
token-parity --overlay-dark-10


